<title>UK: Austria adds 50 mln DEM to 10-year fix/reverse FRN.</title>
<headline>Austria adds 50 mln DEM to 10-year fix/reverse FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 150 million marks from 100 million marks lead manager Morgan Stanley Bank AG said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   REPUBLIC OF AUSTRIA</p>
<p> AMT   *150 MLN DEM   COUPON   **9.0	 MATURITY    21.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIX/REV FRN   ISS PRICE  102.125   PAY DATE    05.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    100.50    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1/625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **UNTIL 1999, THEN 16.5 PCT LESS 2 TIMES 6M LIBOR</p>
<p>	     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 100 MLN MARKS ON 24.APR.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
